$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=holidrect  LOC_AFTER=?

* The identity theorem on a rectangle: a holomorphic function on an open set containing the rectangle enlarged by R that vanishes on some disc about a point of the rectangle vanishes on the whole rectangle.

